1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,140
Man: I'm so excited for the outdoor concert this weekend.

2
00:00:07,140 --> 00:00:10,140
Woman: Have you seen the weather forecast? We'll get soaked.

3
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:14,080
Man: Well that's disappointing. I was really looking forward to going.

4
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:17,020
Woman: Same here. Any thoughts on what to do instead?

5
00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:20,720
Man: I heard there's a new exhibit opening on Saturday at the art gallery

6
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,280
Tickets go on sale tomorrow.

7
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:26,170
Woman: Count me in. We can meet up for breakfast that morning too.
